{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1460358-forgotten-plot-hook-caitiff-holy-gangsters-with-chainsaws","id":1460358,"title":"Forgotten plot hook: Caitiff holy gangsters with chainsaws!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-09-18T12:58:14-07:00","id":1460358,"title":"Forgotten plot hook: Caitiff holy gangsters with chainsaws!","content":"I've recently bought out of collection mania a Revised corebook, and was reading through the Hunters' part of the Antagonist section: there's a nice bit about Caitiff-led Colombian gangs in New York attacking the Giovanni with chainsaws!<br /> <br /> Everything is presented as shrouded in mistery, hinting at wider developments and hidden threats to vampire society rising up: those Caitiff are presented as interpreting the role of divine messengers, absolving gangsters from their sins in exchange for a good 'ol crusade.<br /> <br /> Aside from being a good summary for a Netflix pulp-gonzo thing, what do you think would have been of this plot, had Revised not go Gehenna? And what would you do now with this plot, in a V20 / V5 setup?<br /> <br /> Was this just a tie-in with Hunter: the Reckoning? Was something which was buried under &quot;WOD: Mafia&quot; bad reception? Would the Giovanni connection and the atonement for past sins point at the Harbinger of Skulls? Moving forward to V20 and V5 could these guys be from the OMEGA plot presented in Beckett's Diary, from the Church of Caine, or would we see the rise of an all-Caitiff and Thin Blooded suprematist faction rooted in supernatural? Or perhaps they come from Drowned Legacies taking their &quot;liberation war&quot; to North America?<br /> <br /> Let's discuss!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}